	(5, 'AGBEVO', 'Abel', 'M', 'staff', 'aagbevo@crec-lshtm.org', 'aagbevo@crec-lshtm.org', 'I am a medical entomologist at the CREC/LSHTM Collaborative Research Programme.I have more than 6 years’ experience in evaluation of malaria vector control products (Laboratory and experimental huts evaluation).The CREC/LSHTM Collaborative Research Programme is a vector control product testing facility with a mission to provide the highest quality data on the efficacy of insecticidal products for use against vectors of human disease in line with guidelines set out by the World Health Organisation (WHO).', 'Mr.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, 9, 'Abel.jpg', 5, 1, '2023-12-26 09:42:26', '2023-12-26 09:42:26'),
	(6, 'ARIORI', 'Victoria', 'F', 'staff', 'variori@crec-lshtm.org', 'variori@crec-lshtm.org', '* Experienced Research and Healthcare Complicance and Regulatory Affairs Specialist with a demonstrated history of working in research laboratory. \r\n* Skilled in OECD Principles of Good Laboratory Practice (in-house and multi-site) and regulatory requirements.\r\n* General knowledge of drug development process\r\n* Knowledge of ICH-Good Clinical Practice and regulatory guidelines/directives\r\n* Excellent written and verbal communication skills in French and English\r\n* Ability to meet deadlines and produce results \r\n* Ability to lead a team and promote team work\r\n* Ability to effectively multi-task and prioritize', 'Mrs.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, 8, 'Victoria.jpg', 6, 1, '2023-12-26 09:42:26', '2023-12-26 09:42:26'),
	(7, 'TODJINOU', 'Damien', 'M', 'staff', 'dtodjinou@crec-lshtm.org', 'dtodjinou@crec-lshtm.org', 'Sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit voluptatem accusantium doloremque laudantium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore veritatis et quasi architecto beatae vitae dicta sunt explicabo. Nemo enim ipsam voluptatem quia voluptas sit aspernatur aut odit aut fugit, sed quia consequuntur magni dolores eos qui ratione voluptatem sequi nesciunt. Neque porro quisquam est, qui dolorem ipsum quia dolor sit amet, consectetur, adipisci velit, sed quia non numquam eius modi tempora incidunt ut labore et dolore magnam aliquam quaerat voluptatem. Ut enim ad minima veniam, quis nostrum exercitationem ullam corporis suscipit laboriosam, nisi ut aliquid ex ea commodi consequatur? Quis autem vel eum iure reprehenderit qui in ea voluptate velit esse quam nihil molestiae consequatur, vel illum qui dolorem eum fugiat quo voluptas nulla pariatur.', 'Mr.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, 11, 'Damien.jpg', 7, 1, '2023-12-26 09:42:26', '2023-12-26 09:42:26'),
	(8, 'HOUEHA', 'Francis', 'M', 'staff', 'fhoueha@crec-lshtm.org', 'fhoueha@crec-lshtm.org', 'I\'m a young passionnate of IT related businesses. I\'ve a great background in computer Engineering (Master Degree) with 8+ years of professionnal work experiences in software Engineering. I\'m familiar with developing applications languages such as : PHP, C++, Javascript, HTML5, CSS3. \r\nMy favourites frameworks are : QT Creator for Desktop applications, Laravel for PHP (web apps), Flutter SDK for both Mobile, web and Desktop apps. \r\nMy favrourites scripts languages are : Python, R\r\n\r\nWriting APIs and Microservices In Python environment is also in my field of skills.\r\n\r\nI\'m also passionnate about Data Science With many MOOC taken in that field and also a Master Degree incoming. \r\nDiscipline, Rigor and Results are my main qualities. \r\nMoreover, Since 2021, I\'m working in a big cross countries epidemiological studies on Lassa Fever and I\'m being used there as a Clinical Data Manager. \r\nWith the rigor of that field (Human Healthcare), I\'m learning a lot of principles and technologies that can be very usefull in any other experiences I\'ll have. I have a good Knowledge and comprehension of Good Clinical Practices (GCP) and Good Clinical Data Management Practices (GCDMP) and many other regulatory authorities in Clinical Data Management fields.\r\n\r\nI\'m very curious and love learning things. Facing new technologies and new challenges is what I seek the most.', 'Mr.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, 10, 'Francis.jpg', 8, 1, '2023-12-26 09:42:26', '2023-12-26 09:42:26');

